WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.360
Welcome to Renew. Renew is designed to be a tool middle school students can use to share

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:08.519
their feelings and discuss things that happened in the past, which can sometimes be difficult

00:00:08.519 --> 00:00:12.759
or awkward. Today we want to hear what you think of Renew. We want to hear things you

00:00:12.759 --> 00:00:17.400
like or don't like about it. There are no right or wrong answers. We want you to take

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:21.320
it like this was something the school gave you to do. If there's anything you don't

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:26.120
want to answer, you can just skip it. Also, remember, if something comes up that you'd

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:30.839
like to talk to someone about, you can always tell the person who you're working with today.

00:00:30.839 --> 00:00:34.880
After finishing Renew, you will complete a brief survey and then the person in the room

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:39.679
with you will ask you some wrap up questions. At any time you need a break or have a question,

00:00:39.679 --> 00:00:44.000
you should feel free to ask the person watching it with you. Once you are done with the interview,

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.679
we will be able to pay you with the gift card at the email you have given us.

